 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "leanerVM",
  "excerpt": "`leanerVM` is a Lean 4 implementation and formalization of [leanVM](https://github.com/leanEthereum/leanVM), leanEthereum's minimal hash-based SNARK virtual machine for post-quantum signature aggregation. Current leanVM uses binary fields and BLAKE2s; the historical KoalaBear/Poseidon implementation remains available on its `koalabear` branch."
 },
